   "q": "24．问：这一信经是怎样划分的呢？"
  },
  {
   "key": "CR-intro.apostles",
   "doc": "CR",
   "n": "apostles",
   "parts": [
    "这一信经被称为《使徒信经》，并不是因为它是使徒写的，而是因为它是对使徒教导所作的总结。"
   ],
   "url": "https://ccifellowship.org/books/book-of-praise/creeds/apostles-creed",
   "label": "使徒信经 · 简介"
  },
  {
   "key": "CR-intro.nicene",
   "doc": "CR",
   "n": "nicene",
   "parts": [
    "《尼西亚信经》又称《尼西亚-君士坦丁堡信经》，它是早期基督教会的正统信仰告白，旨在驳斥某些异端，尤其是亚流主义。"
   ],
   "url": "https://ccifellowship.org/books/book-of-praise/creeds/nicene-creed",
   "label": "尼西亚信经 · 简介"
  },
  {
   "key": "CR-intro.athanasian",
   "doc": "CR",
   "n": "athanasian",
   "parts": [
    "撇开信经的开头和结尾，《亚他那修信经》可以分为两个部分："
   ],
   "url": "https://ccifellowship.org/books/book-of-praise/creeds/athanasian-creed",
   "label": "亚他那修信经 · 简介"
  },
  {
   "key": "CR-intro.apostles",
   "doc": "CR",
   "n": "apostles",
   "parts": [
    "今天的《使徒信经》是以公元400年左右罗马教会所使用的信经为基础的，而后者的启用可以再往前追溯二百年。"
   ],
   "url": "https://ccifellowship.org/books/book-of-praise/creeds/apostles-creed",
   "label": "使徒信经 · 简介"
  },
  {
   "key": "CR-intro.athanasian",
   "doc": "CR",
   "n": "athanasian",
   "parts": [
    "《亚他那修信经》最早出现于6世纪上半叶，"
   ],
   "url": "https://ccifellowship.org/books/book-of-praise/creeds/athanasian-creed",
   "label": "亚他那修信经 · 简介"
  },
  {
   "key": "CR.apostles",
   "doc": "CR",
   "n": "apostles",
   "parts": [
    "我信神，全能的父"
   ],
   "url": "https://ccifellowship.org/books/book-of-praise/creeds/apostles-creed",
   "label": "使徒信经"
  },
  {
   "key": "CR.nicene",
   "doc": "CR",
   "n": "nicene",
   "parts": [
    "我们信独一的神"
   ],
   "url": "https://ccifellowship.org/books/book-of-praise/creeds/nicene-creed",
   "label": "尼西亚信经"
  },
  {
   "key": "CR.apostles",
   "doc": "CR",
   "n": "apostles",
   "parts": [
    "创造天地的主"
   ],
   "url": "https://ccifellowship.org/books/book-of-praise/creeds/apostles-creed",
   "label": "使徒信经"
  },
  {
   "key": "CR.nicene",
   "doc": "CR",
   "n": "nicene",
   "parts": [
    "创造天地及其中可见不可见之万物的主"
   ],
   "url": "https://ccifellowship.org/books/book-of-praise/creeds/nicene-creed",
   "label": "尼西亚信经"
  },
  {
   "key": "CR.athanasian",
   "doc": "CR",
   "n": "athanasian",
   "parts": [
    "父是自有的，既非受造，也非受生"
   ],
   "url": "https://ccifellowship.org/books/book-of-praise/creeds/athanasian-creed",
   "label": "亚他那修信经"
  },
  {
   "key": "CR.apostles",
   "doc": "CR",
   "n": "apostles",
   "parts": [
    "神的独生子"
   ],
   "url": "https://ccifellowship.org/books/book-of-praise/creeds/apostles-creed",
   "label": "使徒信经"
  },
  {
   "key": "CR.nicene",
   "doc": "CR",
   "n": "nicene",
   "parts": [
    "受生却非被造，与父同质"
   ],
   "url": "https://ccifellowship.org/books/book-of-praise/creeds/nicene-creed",
   "label": "尼西亚信经"
  },
  {
   "key": "CR.athanasian",
   "doc": "CR",
   "n": "athanasian",
   "parts": [
    "子独出于父，非受造，乃是受生"
   ],
   "url": "https://ccifellowship.org/books/book-of-praise/creeds/athanasian-creed",
   "label": "亚他那修信经"
  },
  {
   "key": "CR.apostles",
   "doc": "CR",
   "n": "apostles",
   "parts": [
    "因圣灵感孕，从童贞女马利亚所生"
   ],
   "url": "https://ccifellowship.org/books/book-of-praise/creeds/apostles-creed",
   "label": "使徒信经"
  },
  {
   "key": "CR.nicene",
   "doc": "CR",
   "n": "nicene",
   "parts": [
    "为了拯救我们，他从天上降世为人"
   ],
   "url": "https://ccifellowship.org/books/book-of-praise/creeds/nicene-creed",
   "label": "尼西亚信经"
  },
  {
   "key": "CR.athanasian",
   "doc": "CR",
   "n": "athanasian",
   "parts": [
    "乃是因神人二性合于一个位格"
   ],
   "url": "https://ccifellowship.org/books/book-of-praise/creeds/athanasian-creed",
   "label": "亚他那修信经"
  },
  {
   "key": "CR.apostles",
   "doc": "CR",
   "n": "apostles",
   "parts": [
    "我信圣灵。"
   ],
   "url": "https://ccifellowship.org/books/book-of-praise/creeds/apostles-creed",
   "label": "使徒信经"
  },
  {
   "key": "CR.nicene",
   "doc": "CR",
   "n": "nicene",
   "parts": [
    "赐生命的主，他从父和子而出，与父和子同受敬拜和尊崇"
   ],
   "url": "https://ccifellowship.org/books/book-of-praise/creeds/nicene-creed",
   "label": "尼西亚信经"
  },
  {
   "key": "CR.athanasian",
   "doc": "CR",
   "n": "athanasian",
   "parts": [
    "圣灵从父和子而出，非受造，也非受生"
   ],
   "url": "https://ccifellowship.org/books/book-of-praise/creeds/athanasian-creed",
   "label": "亚他那修信经"
  },
  {
   "key": "CR.apostles",
   "doc": "CR",
   "n": "apostles",
   "parts": [
    "我相信圣而公之教会，我相信圣徒相通"
   ],
   "url": "https://ccifellowship.org/books/book-of-praise/creeds/apostles-creed",
   "label": "使徒信经"
  },
  {
   "key": "CR.nicene",
   "doc": "CR",
   "n": "nicene",
   "parts": [
    "我们相信世上只有一个圣而公之使徒性教会"
   ],
   "url": "https://ccifellowship.org/books/book-of-praise/creeds/nicene-creed",
   "label": "尼西亚信经"
  },
  {
   "key": "CR.apostles",
   "doc": "CR",
   "n": "apostles",
   "parts": [
    "我相信罪得赦免"
   ],
   "url": "https://ccifellowship.org/books/book-of-praise/creeds/apostles-creed",
   "label": "使徒信经"
  },
  {
   "key": "CR.nicene",
   "doc": "CR",
   "n": "nicene",
   "parts": [
    "我们承认印证了罪得赦免的独一洗礼"
   ],
   "url": "https://ccifellowship.org/books/book-of-praise/creeds/nicene-creed",
   "label": "尼西亚信经"
  },
  {
   "key": "CR.apostles",
   "doc": "CR",
   "n": "apostles",
   "parts": [
    "我相信身体复活"
   ],
   "url": "https://ccifellowship.org/books/book-of-praise/creeds/apostles-creed",
   "label": "使徒信经"
  },
  {
   "key": "CR.nicene",
   "doc": "CR",
   "n": "nicene",
   "parts": [
    "以及完全被更新的世界的到来"
   ],
   "url": "https://ccifellowship.org/books/book-of-praise/creeds/nicene-creed",
   "label": "尼西亚信经"
  },
  {
   "key": "CR.athanasian",
   "doc": "CR",
