   "url": "https://ccifellowship.org/books/book-of-praise/confessions/the-belgic-confession/11",
   "parts": [
    "我们相信并宣告圣灵从永恒中由父与子而出。"
   ],
   "q": ""
  },
  {
   "key": "BC.9",
   "doc": "BC",
   "n": 9,
   "h": null,
   "label": "《比利时信条》第九条 三位一体论的圣经依据",
   "url": "https://ccifellowship.org/books/book-of-praise/confessions/the-belgic-confession/9",
   "parts": [
